{"3754310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cave Crawler: Volume 2", "steam_appid": 3754310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5073910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/f2474c68653a5ed61d54a3e95191e55e.poster.avif?t=1787434429\" width=1000 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/f2474c68653a5ed61d54a3e95191e55e.webm?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/f2474c68653a5ed61d54a3e95191e55e.mp4?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the found footage of Carl Watson as he attempts to escape Rockwell Mining Group's White Hound Mine after a major earthquake rips through the cave systems. Crawl, run, and shimmy your way through this caving experience to survive the horrors lurking through the underground, and discover what would drive a man to go so deep into the bowels of the earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set 2 years after Cave Crawler, Cave Crawler Volume 2 follows the story of Carl Watson, a foreman working at Rockwell Mining Group's Alaskan mining operation. What starts as a routine site inspection quickly turns into a tense, claustrophobic nightmare as Carl tries to escape back to the surface before he finds out first hand why RMG has such an interest in this mine. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawling: Experience for yourself why caving is so horrifying, from the safety of your computer. Crawl your way through crevices, tight hallways, and mine shafts so constricted they'll take your breath away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/d77f5076bb280254f13f26f5e0866973.poster.avif?t=1787434429\" width=1000 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/d77f5076bb280254f13f26f5e0866973.webm?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/d77f5076bb280254f13f26f5e0866973.mp4?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scanning: Equipped with a Rockwell Technologies patented Site Inspection Recorder, scan whatever you can to try to and find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/7fc65ee610425b56fee6ab371eca6b6e.poster.avif?t=1787434429\" width=1000 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/7fc65ee610425b56fee6ab371eca6b6e.webm?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/7fc65ee610425b56fee6ab371eca6b6e.mp4?t=1787434429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conspiracy: Discover the secrets of our earth laying just beneath your feet, and just how much THEY don't want you to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754310/extras/7db4d53165e92de6ab6eff0feb8060d